  "paragraph": 36,
  "text": "So the next time your AI agent feels unreliable, slow, or weirdly forgetful, resist the urge to immediately swap models or rewrite your system prompt for the tenth time. Audit the harness around it instead. Give the model cleaner tools with actionable errors, protect your static cache prefix, wire in closed-loop verification with deterministic hooks, and lock down a scoped sandbox with sensible human approval gates. More often than not, the intelligence was already there; it just needed a better operating system.",
